WEBVTT

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.083
with the way our brains are built.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:35.226
That said, women's brains
differ from men's brains

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.643
in some respects.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.893
And I'm here to talk
about these differences,

00:00:38.917 --> 00:00:42.226
because they actually matter
for our health.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.518
For example,

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:47.309
women are more likely than men
to be diagnosed with an anxiety disorder

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.726
or depression,

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.476
not to mention headaches and migraines.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.976
But also, at the core of my research,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.726
women are more likely than men
to have Alzheimer's disease.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.018
Alzheimer's disease
is the most common cause